The Guybile
Copyright (c) 2026 miolo-hub, maintainer of theguybile.com. All rights reserved.

The official and only authorised home of The Guybile is https://theguybile.com.

1. What you may do

   - Read the book and the website.
   - Share links to the website and to individual verses.
   - Share single verses, or images of single verses made with the website's
     own share tools, on social media and in messages, with credit to
     "The Guybile" or a link to theguybile.com.
   - Fork this repository on GitHub only to propose changes back to it
     through pull requests.

2. What you may not do without written permission from the copyright holder

   - Host, mirror or publish the website, the book, or a substantial part of
     either anywhere else.
   - Sell, print or publish the book or its verses, in any form.
   - Make or sell merchandise, apps or other products that use the name
     "The Guybile", its verses or its artwork.
   - Use the name "The Guybile" for another site, book or product.

3. Contributions

   By submitting a verse, edit or other contribution (through an issue, a pull
   request or any other way), you confirm that it is your own original work,
   and you grant the copyright holder a perpetual, worldwide, irrevocable,
   royalty-free licence to use, edit, publish, print, sell and sublicense it as
   part of The Guybile, in any medium, including printed books and
   merchandise. You may be credited by the name you give, but you are not
   entitled to payment. You keep the right to use your own words elsewhere.

4. Code

   The build scripts and website code in this repository may be read and
   studied. Reusing them for an unrelated project needs written permission.

THE WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. IN NO EVENT SHALL
THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY
ARISING FROM THE USE OF THE WORK.
